    "prayers_note": "None saved. The prayer “Resta con me, Signore”, widely attributed to Padre Pio as a prayer after Communion, was not checked in Italian and its authorship is uncertain; it is excluded on the caller’s instruction. No other authentic prayer by or to him was found in the notes."
